.TH tuxml n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tuxml
.PP
Small XML text helper in pure Tcl 8.6+.
.PP
This module is not a validating XML parser. It provides writer/helper routines for scripts that need to generate simple XML safely:
.IP \(bu
\fBescape text ?\-quotes boolean?\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBunescape text\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBdeclaration ?encoding?\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBattrs dict\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBtag name ?attrs?\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBelement name attrs content\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBtextElement name attrs text\fR
.SS Example
.CS
package require tclutils::tuxml

puts [::tclutils::tuxml::declaration]
puts [::tclutils::tuxml::textElement title {} {A < B & C}]
.CE
.SS Notes
.PP
Use \fBtextElement\fR when content is plain text. Use \fBelement\fR only when the content is already XML markup.
